  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are even more sensitive to what the earth tells you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Murmurs of Earth<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can gain your tremorsense ability as a swift action. Additionally, you can expend one use of mythic power to increase the range to 30 feet and increase the duration by 1 round for every three mythic tiers you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc94\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
